//! Flat storage `flat_lineitem` of table `lineitem` (generated by GenDB, gendb-flat-storage-v1; not author code).
//!
//! Every column of the table as a plain typed array in source row order: stored row `i` is source row `i`. One
//! part per column, two for a text column (offsets, bytes), in column order. No sorting, partitioning, index,
//! permutation, compression, dictionary or skip metadata. The element type follows the declared SQL type only:
//! bigint I64; integer I32; date I32 days since 1970-01-01; numeric(p,s) I128 coefficient (value =
//! coefficient * 10^-s); text, varchar and char I64 offsets (rows + 1, positions in the bytes part, the first not
//! necessarily 0) and U8 UTF-8 bytes, value `i` = bytes[offsets[i] .. offsets[i + 1]].
//!
//! `represents(parts, rels)`: `rels` is the one stored table and its row `i` is `row_at(parts, i)`. The readers
//! read extents through `StoredParts` and state what they return in terms of `rels`.
//!
//! Parts:
//!    0 L_ORDERKEY: l_orderkey (bigint), I64 value
//!    1 L_PARTKEY: l_partkey (bigint), I64 value
//!    2 L_SUPPKEY: l_suppkey (bigint), I64 value
//!    3 L_LINENUMBER: l_linenumber (bigint), I64 value
//!    4 L_QUANTITY: l_quantity (numeric(15,2)), I128 coefficient (value = coefficient * 10^-scale)
//!    5 L_EXTENDEDPRICE: l_extendedprice (numeric(15,2)), I128 coefficient (value = coefficient * 10^-scale)
//!    6 L_DISCOUNT: l_discount (numeric(15,2)), I128 coefficient (value = coefficient * 10^-scale)
//!    7 L_TAX: l_tax (numeric(15,2)), I128 coefficient (value = coefficient * 10^-scale)
//!    8 L_RETURNFLAG_OFFSETS: l_returnflag (text), I64 offsets (rows + 1) into the bytes part
//!    9 L_RETURNFLAG_BYTES: l_returnflag (text), U8 UTF-8 bytes
//!   10 L_LINESTATUS_OFFSETS: l_linestatus (text), I64 offsets (rows + 1) into the bytes part
//!   11 L_LINESTATUS_BYTES: l_linestatus (text), U8 UTF-8 bytes
//!   12 L_SHIPDATE: l_shipdate (date), I32 days since 1970-01-01
//!   13 L_COMMITDATE: l_commitdate (date), I32 days since 1970-01-01
//!   14 L_RECEIPTDATE: l_receiptdate (date), I32 days since 1970-01-01
//!   15 L_SHIPINSTRUCT_OFFSETS: l_shipinstruct (text), I64 offsets (rows + 1) into the bytes part
//!   16 L_SHIPINSTRUCT_BYTES: l_shipinstruct (text), U8 UTF-8 bytes
//!   17 L_SHIPMODE_OFFSETS: l_shipmode (text), I64 offsets (rows + 1) into the bytes part
//!   18 L_SHIPMODE_BYTES: l_shipmode (text), U8 UTF-8 bytes
//!   19 L_COMMENT_OFFSETS: l_comment (text), I64 offsets (rows + 1) into the bytes part
//!   20 L_COMMENT_BYTES: l_comment (text), U8 UTF-8 bytes
